    <string name="prayer_at_these_times">At these times</string>
    <string name="prayer_silence_note">Chosen separately from the athan: wanting the phone quiet while you pray and wanting to hear the call are different decisions.</string>
    <string name="prayer_islamic_date">Islamic date</string>
    <string name="prayer_hijri_note">Worked out arithmetically, from the tabular calendar — it needs no network and always has an answer, but the real month begins on a sighting of the crescent, which can fall a day either side. Nudge it to match what was announced where you are.</string>
